# The game and the workshop are ES modules loaded by relative path, and the
# host's default for .js is thirty days with no revalidation. A returning
# visitor would pick up a fresh index.html and keep running last month's
# engine against this month's boards. So every script and data file here
# revalidates like the page does. If the host ever stops honouring this, the
# fallback is a hashed directory per release; see README.md, Deploying.
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
  <FilesMatch "\.(js|json|svg)$">
    Header set Cache-Control "max-age=60, must-revalidate"
  </FilesMatch>
</IfModule>
